ry you'd still be able to  hop on a plane for travel  while planes use wind in flight  they don't need it wind simply helps  them get airborne  faster without it they'd just need to  burn more fuel  to reach the speeds needed for liftoff  wind is important to our atmosphere and  is often taken for granted  it's a case of out of sight out of mind  not only does it provide a cool breeze  during a hot day  it also creates our cherished ecosystems  no wind well there wouldn't even be the  amazon rainforest  and since the amazon produces 25  of the world's oxygen it would be bad  news for us  if we lost it but  that's a story for another what if  you

